      "content": "<h3>Creating a HashSet: four constructors</h3>\n<ul>\n<li><code>new HashSet&lt;&gt;()</code>: empty, capacity 16, load factor 0.75.</li>\n<li><code>new HashSet&lt;&gt;(int initialCapacity)</code>: empty with room for about that many buckets.</li>\n<li><code>new HashSet&lt;&gt;(int initialCapacity, float loadFactor)</code>: control both numbers.</li>\n<li><code>new HashSet&lt;&gt;(Collection c)</code>: a set holding the elements of another collection (<strong>duplicates are dropped</strong>).</li>\n</ul>",
