      "content": "<h3>All HashSet methods at a glance</h3>\n<p><em>n</em> is the number of elements, <em>m</em> the size of the other collection.</p>\n<table border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"8\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"border-collapse:collapse; width:100%;\">\n<tr><th style=\"text-align:left;\">Method</th><th style=\"text-align:left;\">What it does</th><th style=\"text-align:left;\">Time</th></tr>\n<tr><td><strong>add(e)</strong></td><td>Adds e if not present; returns whether it was added</td><td>O(1) average</td></tr>\n<tr><td><strong>addAll(c)</strong></td><td>Adds every element of c (union)</td><td>O(m)</td></tr>\n<tr><td><strong>remove(o)</strong></td><td>Removes o if present; returns whether it was</td><td>O(1) average</td></tr>\n<tr><td><strong>removeAll(c)</strong></td><td>Removes every element found in c (difference)</td><td>O(m) to O(n*m)</td></tr>\n<tr><td><strong>retainAll(c)</strong></td><td>Keeps only elements found in c (intersection)</td><td>O(n)</td></tr>\n<tr><td><strong>removeIf(p)</strong></td><td>Removes all elements matching a condition</td><td>O(n)</td></tr>\n<tr><td><strong>contains(o)</strong> / <strong>containsAll(c)</strong></td><td>Membership tests</td><td>O(1) / O(m)</td></tr>\n<tr><td><strong>size()</strong> / <strong>isEmpty()</strong> / <strong>clear()</strong></td><td>Count, emptiness, remove all</td><td>O(1) / O(1) / O(capacity)</td></tr>\n<tr><td><strong>iterator()</strong> / <strong>forEach(a)</strong></td><td>Visit every element</td><td>O(n + capacity)</td></tr>\n<tr><td><strong>stream()</strong> / <strong>toArray()</strong></td><td>Stream / array copy</td><td>O(n)</td></tr>\n<tr><td><strong>clone()</strong></td><td>Shallow copy</td><td>O(n)</td></tr>\n<tr><td><strong>equals(o)</strong> / <strong>hashCode()</strong> / <strong>toString()</strong></td><td>Same elements regardless of order / hash / text</td><td>O(n)</td></tr>\n<tr><td><strong>Set.of(...)</strong> / <strong>Set.copyOf(c)</strong></td><td>Immutable sets</td><td>O(n)</td></tr>\n</table>"
